## Token Reference — CSS Custom Properties

Paste this `:root` block into every new project. All values come from active-brand.json. Do not hardcode.

```css
:root {
  /* Typography families */
  /* --font-display: Display typeface for headings and large callouts. */
  --font-display: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
  /* --font-body: Body typeface for all paragraph text, form fields, and descriptions. */
  --font-body: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-utility: "JetBrains Mono", Courier New, monospace;

  /* Type scale */
  --type-h1: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  --type-h2: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
  --type-h3: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
  --type-body: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.125rem);
  --type-small: 0.875rem;
  --type-label: 0.75rem;

  /* Colors */
  /* --color-backgrounds-page: Primary page background. White baseline. */
  --color-backgrounds-page: #FFFFFF;
  /* --color-backgrounds-surface: Card and panel backgrounds. Slightly off-white. */
  --color-backgrounds-surface: #F8FAFC;
  /* --color-backgrounds-elevated: Elevated surfaces such as dropdowns, popovers, and modals. */
  --color-backgrounds-elevated: #F1F5F9;
  --color-backgrounds-dark: #0F172A;
  /* --color-text-primary: Primary text color for headings and body copy. */
  --color-text-primary: #0F172A;
  /* --color-text-secondary: Secondary text for supporting copy and metadata. */
  --color-text-secondary: #475569;
  /* --color-text-muted: Muted text for placeholder copy, disabled states, and decorative labels. WCAG: fails 4.5:1 on backgrounds.page. Do not use for meaningful body text. Use text.secondary instead. */
  --color-text-muted: #94A3B8;
  --color-text-inverse: #F8FAFC;
  --color-structural-border: #E2E8F0;
  --color-structural-divider: #CBD5E1;
  /* --color-accent-primary: Primary interactive accent. Used for CTAs, links, and focus indicators. */
  --color-accent-primary: #2563EB;
  --color-accent-primary-hover: #1D4ED8;
  --color-accent-secondary: #7C3AED;
  --color-semantic-success: #16A34A;
  --color-semantic-warning: #CA8A04;
