## Layout Declaration

**Every build begins with a Layout Declaration before any CSS is written.**

Format for each section:
```
Section: [name]
Pattern: [named pattern]
Derivation: exact | modified: [description] | derived-from: [pattern]
Rationale: [why this pattern + brand cluster]
Spacing tier: [generous/standard/tight]
```

### Preferred patterns for this brand (Cluster A)
- Hero-First
- Alternating Narrative
- Bento Marketing
- Data Dashboard

### Spacing derivation
Spacing density is **balanced**. All section padding comes from the tiers below.

### Section Padding Tiers (from spacing_density: balanced)
- **generous:** clamp(6rem, 10vw, 9rem)
- **standard:** clamp(4rem, 7vw, 6rem)
- **tight:** clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem)

