## Component Library

**Source:** https://github.com/example/design-system
**Framework:** React + TypeScript
**Inventory:** 1 components indexed

Before building any component:
1. Check the component inventory — if it exists, use it or extend it
2. If building new, match existing naming and prop conventions
3. Never rebuild what already exists

---

## Motion Rules

Functional and unobtrusive. Motion communicates state change, not personality. Prefer fast transitions (200-300ms). No decorative animations.

All animations require `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` variants.

